              "name": "Frost Charge",
              "cost": 1,
              "epiphany": {
                "level": 0,
                "name": "Frost Charge",
                "text": {
                  "en": "140% Shield. 3 Vulnerable to all enemies."
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Magna Lead. CounterAttack, Crystallization and Vulnerable"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Lead\nLead is a RNG Keyword that can reduce the card's cost 1 AP 50% of the time\nThe discount can only happen if it's the first card you play that turn\nTop of deck manipulation with Cassius/Nia or Precision aim can help\nCounterAttack\nWhen an enemy attacks your team, for every hit they deal\n1 CounterAttack is consumed, and the owner deals Defense Based Damage\nCounterAttacks are not fixed damage, so they are effected by buffs/debuffs\nCOUNTERS CAN CRIT NOW YAY\nCrystallization:\nEnd of your turn gain a tiny bit of FIXED shield for every Crystallization Stack\nVulnerable:\nWhen damage is dealt, Vuln is consumed and recieves 1.5x dmg multiplier"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Multifacted Parallel Universe Nexus or Lead Prism is INSANE on Magna\nActivating 1 random Lead card (Prism's owner only) is a big AP Cheat\nEspecially so on Magna, where her Lead cards can be 2 Cost!"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2-4-patch-notes",
